        'Marija Langwagen, Jette Jacobsen, Tue Christensen and Anders Poulsen: The Danish Food Composition Database, Frida version 5.5, November 2025, National Food Institute, Technical University of Denmark. https://doi.org/10.11583/DTU.29500682', '5.5', '2026-10-13', 'verified',
